    "why": [
      "Saves 38% irrigation water (245 mm/yr \u2014 ~3 flood irrigations and 135 hrs/ha of 5-HP borewell pumping) vs. baseline [FAO-56]. Directly counters regional GRACE-FO terrestrial water storage decline of 4.2 cm/yr.",
      "Elevates Soil Health Score to 72/100 (+31 pts vs. baseline) and changes 10-year topsoil organic carbon by +1.0 t C/ha, saving 4.1 bags/ha of 45-kg Urea via biological N fixation [RothC-lite \u00b7 SoilGrids].",
      "Provides a 34-day Kharif-to-Rabi turnaround window for Happy Seeder / zero-till sowing with in-situ residue mulching \u2014 eliminating Oct\u2013Nov stubble burning monitored by NASA FIRMS.",
      "Timely sowing schedule buffers crops against 131 annual extreme heat days (>35\u00b0C) and 12.3 March\u2013April terminal grain-filling heat days (>32\u00b0C) recorded by NASA POWER.",
      "Delivers median net operating return of \u20b9197,624/ha (\u20b979,976/acre) with a worst-10% drought downside buffer (CVaR-10) of \u20b9174,517/ha (\u20b970,625/acre) [CACP MSP 2024-25]. Eligible schemes: PM-PRANAM Alternative Fertiliser & Bio-N Incentive; NFSM-Pulses & NAFED e-Samridhi Assured MSP Procurement."
    ],
